egrating safety verification as a gated step in the CI/CD pipeline. By treating safety as a non-negotiable performance metric, you ensure that your product iteration is sustainable, defensible, and resilient against the inevitable scrutiny of both the market and regulators. The goal is to build a foundation that can support compounding growth, rather than one that crumbles under the weight of its own unmanaged technical and ethical debt.",
