or AI Standards and Innovation—rather than relying on the performative protection of an insurance market. I recommend that the board shift investment away from seeking 'insurance-based' regulatory loopholes and toward internalizing the cost of safety through rigorous, iterative red-teaming and verifiable compliance frameworks, which are the only mechanisms capable of providing genuine operational risk mitigation.",
